
>> city := Sanaw ← ['London'] ; ['Paris'] ; ['Berlin'].
>> temperature := Sanaw ← ['15'] ; ['16'] ; ['15'].
>> weather := temperature boýunça: city.
>> cities := weather açarlar tertiple: { :a :b <- (a deňeşdir: b). }.
>> temperatures := weather bahalar tertiple: { :a :b <- (a deňeşdir: b) otrisatel?. }.

Çykyş ýaz: (cities birleşdir: [',']), täze-setir.
Çykyş ýaz: (temperatures birleşdir: [',']), täze-setir.
